      549.18
    ],
    "text": "I, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for apublic purpose and the land will be acquired under provision thatAct.",
